{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05520","headline":"同家兄题渭南王公别业 · 蔡希寂","name":"同家兄题渭南王公别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好闲知在家，退迹何必深。\n不出人境外，萧条江海心。\n轩车自来往，空名对清阴。\n川涘将钓玉，乡亭期散金。\n素晖射流濑，翠色緜森林。\n曾爲诗书癖，宁惟耕稼任。\n吾兄许微尚，枉道来相寻。\n朝庆老莱服，夕闲安道琴。\n文章遥颂美，寤寐增所钦。\n既郁苍生望，明时岂陆沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡希寂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}